  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup unsweetened vanilla-flavored almond milk",
    "1 cup vanilla fat-free yogurt",
    "2 tablespoons pure maple syrup",
    "1 teaspoon pure vanilla extract",
    "0.125 teaspoon salt",
    "0.25 cup chia seeds",
    "1 pint strawberries, hulled and chopped",
    "4 teaspoons pure maple syrup",
    "0.25 cup toasted almonds"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kHy0lBqQO1mc_KbRGdfZXjVXobw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/237680-chia-seed-pudding-DDMFS-118-4x3-step-01-7f50b913891d401a928350f67297ebbd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/237680/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk almond milk, yogurt, 2 tablespoons maple syrup, vanilla, and salt together in a bowl until just blended; add chia seeds, whisk to incorporate, and let the chia seeds soak for 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NU0ohWIyQhKYy7NskwCXQdo2arE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/237680-chia-seed-pudding-DDMFS-119-4x3-step-02-1447fa9149b248539f0cc30b86a305a6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/237680/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir the chia seed mixture to redistribute seeds that have settled throughout the mixture. Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate 8 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WbkUWdsh40_r7Zct-zq2HUz7bz8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/237680-chia-seed-pudding-DDMFS-120-4x3-step-03-0634c437494e4e33a510d558bcaac114.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/237680/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drizzle 4 teaspoons maple syrup over strawberries in a bowl; stir to coat. Add almonds to strawberries; stir.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mmg82AbRgdkQ42-dlZTF1RK8XEY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/237680-chia-seed-pudding-DDMFS-121-4x3-step-04-3c37c2361f6a4b93b9897bbb4faeb715.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/237680/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon chia seed mixture into 4 bowls; top each with a portion of the strawberry mixture.",
      "section": null,
